{{Term/Store|Stealth Tights|Stealth Tights|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/> Stealth Tights go unnamed in {{SSBU}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Stealth Tights are a piece of [[Armor]] which can be purchased at [[Enchanted]] in [[Kakariko Village]]. According to their description, the noise-suppressing cloth used to make the Tights are a hallmark of ancient [[Sheikah]] technology.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> When worn, they provide one level of [[Stealth Up]]. The Stealth Tights can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and can be [[Hateno Dye|Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Stealth Tights, alongside the [[Stealth Mask]] and [[Stealth Chest Guard]], compose the [[Stealth Set]]. When each piece of the Set has been enhanced at least two times by a Great Fairy and the full Set is worn, it provides the [[Night Speed Up]] [[Set Bonus]].

